  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.1 (2026-06-29) - Dependency Update: Portamical.Core.Formatting v2.0.0 → v2.1.0\n\n    This release updates the formatting library dependency to v2.1.0, bringing significant performance optimizations and quality improvements - all with full backward compatibility.\n\n    **Key Improvements** (via Portamical.Core.Formatting v2.1.0):\n    • 5-15% faster collection formatting (4-32 items) via pre-computed StringBuilder capacity\n    • 2-5x faster ASCII character formatting with single unsigned bounds check\n    • 10-100x faster KeyValuePair property access via compiled delegate accessors (2nd+ access)\n    • 2-3x faster type alias lookups using reference equality caching\n    • 2-5x faster delegate method detection using SearchValues with SIMD\n    • Eliminated redundant null checks and reduced allocation overhead\n    • Enhanced test coverage: 319 → 353 tests (+10.7%)\n    • Fixed XML documentation warnings and improved code organization\n\n    **Compatibility**: ✅ No breaking changes, drop-in replacement for v4.1.0\n\n    For details: https://github.com/CsabaDu/Portamical/blob/master/Portamical.Core.Formatting/README.md",
